WEBVTT

00:04:55.463 --> 00:05:01.530
The Atlas is a creative attempt
to visualize these invisible populations

00:05:01.563 --> 00:05:03.730
in an effort to understand
the unique process

00:05:03.763 --> 00:05:05.630
of informal city making.

00:05:07.397 --> 00:05:11.663
A crucial question
that we wanted to resolve here

00:05:11.697 --> 00:05:14.263
was how these places evolve over time.

00:05:15.163 --> 00:05:16.663
This was important

00:05:16.663 --> 00:05:19.863
not only to understand the past,

00:05:19.897 --> 00:05:23.630
but more importantly,
the future of informal settlements

00:05:23.663 --> 00:05:26.863
and the future of all world cities.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.163
We at Environmental Design Program